From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Feb 2026 20:19:12 +0530
Subject: feat: add override hooks for 10 remaining crypto.subtle methods

Add MaybeSubtleCryptoOverride<T> template helper and override checks
for decrypt, sign, verify, digest, generateKey, importKey, exportKey,
wrapKey, deriveBits, and deriveKey via window.customOverrides.subtleCrypto.

